# Telos, Residential 082 East and Entertainment Module 081 (TSL, 203TEL,
# 202TEL): free on the station, the A apartments' footlockers (A2's owner
# comes in: just looking around), the information terminal's map, the
# shuttle to 081, the Sullustan the mercenaries hassle (we fight them: LSP,
# and refuse his reward: LSP), 081's terminal, the TSF office: the droid's
# paperwork, our things from the storage lockers, Lieutenant Grenn's work
# (the new fuel source, the bounties). Starts from the arrest's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @telos_free data/routes/tsl/telos_081.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Residential 082 East" and "Entertainment Module
# 081" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/).
use ComplexA         # the A block
use Apartment@4     # A2
use CivilFootLker@2  # its footlocker: the owner comes in
say Just looking around
talk
use Apartment_Falt   # A3
use CivilFootLker@1  # no one rushes to its defence
say =Log out.        # the information terminal: the map downloaded, this
use info_term        # level a transit stop
talk
exit Ent081          # the shuttle to Entertainment Module 081
module 202tel
save telos_081
say his side of the story # the Sullustan hassled by two mercenaries: we
say I think you should leave now # take his side and fight them (LSP)
say You asked for it
say Why are they allowed # then his thanks, as the fight ends: a reward
say You should leave # refused (LSP)
say Keep your credits
to tr_mercs
talk
fight 20
talk
say =Log out.        # 081's information terminal
use info_term
talk
use 202_TSFDroid     # the droid: the ship and T3 gone, our things in the
talk                 # storage room, which it opens
use LockerTSF        # the storage room's lockers: our things in the
use LockerTSF1       # detainee lockers, and the others' too (DSimpson)
use LockerTSFINV@1
use LockerTSFINV@2
use LockerTSFINV@3
use LockerTSFINV@4
use LockerTSFINV@5
equip
save telos_tsf
# Lieutenant Grenn: how the station will survive without Peragus (the new
# fuel source), and his work: the bounties (Batono, the escaped criminals).
say How will you recover
say If I can help, I'd like to
say Do you have any work
say Tell me about the bounties
say Tell me about Batono
say I'll see what I can dig up
say I have some other questions about the bounties
say Tell me about the criminals
say I'll see what I can dig up
use 202_Gren
talk
use 202_Gren         # again: his work
talk
save telos_grenn
exit d_Docks         # down to Dock Module 126 (DSimpson's bounty leads)
module 201tel
say =Log out.        # the docks' information terminal
use info_term
talk
say looking for a man named Batono # the Czerka officer by dock 3's door:
say You don't know? # Batono a Czerka employee, no more
say Czerka employee?
say =I'll be going now. # not the threat (DSP)
use czerka_dock
talk
say information about a passenger # the Duros at dock 3's counter: the
say protecting a killer # false Batu Rem's passage ([Persuade], then 25
say He left no other evidence # credits): he came from Nar Shaddaa
say [Persuade]
say Twenty-five credits it is
say =Batu Rem.
use dockduros
talk
save telos_docks
exit Urban           # back up to 081 and Grenn: the false Batu Rem's
module 202tel        # passage (his reward: Armorply Plating)
say I found some information about Batu Rem
say The assassin Batu Rem
say He arrived from Nar Shaddaa
use 202_Gren
talk
exit d_Suburban      # to Residential 082 East and the Czerka offices: Jana
module 203tel        # Lorso on Batono, who spent time with the Ithorians
exit Czerka          # (the escaped criminals are with her)
module 209tel
save telos_czerka
say =I'll be going now. # B-4D4 at the door: Lorso expects us
say Wait! You're the criminals # the escaped criminals with Lorso: shuttled
use 203_Lorso        # to the planet; they flee (the bounty goes on there)
talk
say Does the name Batono # Lorso: Batono, a former employee who spent time
say He's gone missing # with the Ithorians; a reward for his whereabouts
say My reasons are my own # (we promise nothing)
say If I find no truth
say =I'll be going now.
use 203_Lorso
talk
save telos_lorso
